abstract: >-
  A benchmark for studying memory in streaming video understanding, focusing
  on how models and memory architectures retain and use earlier visual information.
  A fixed 657-question reproducibility release with 647 multiple-choice
  questions, 10 open-ended questions, public reference answers, a local
  scorer, and aggregate evaluation results. Source videos are obtained
  separately under their original licenses.
